  "description": "Official MiniMax Open Platform APIs on the v2 agent model contract (INPUT llm_input → OUTPUT llm_output). operation selects chat (POST /v1/chat/completions), generate_image (POST /v1/image_generation), tts (POST /v1/t2a_v2), or generate_video (POST /v2/video_generation). Auth is StudioQuack secret api_key sent as Bearer. File/image/video payloads use type file (platform ref-id). Docs: https://platform.minimax.io/docs/api-reference/api-overview. Terms: https://www.minimax.io/terms-of-service-v2.html. Never log api_key.",
  "icon": "psychology",
